libreac (1.12.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 1.12.1: 1.12.0 was tagged but never served (its publish was refused
    by the channel gate: reac-pw 1.0.44 needs libreac.so.7). This release is
    the same code with .github/release-same-pass, so the tag run excuses
    reac-pw and reac-stageboxes, which are rebuilt against it in the same pass
    (reac-pw 1.1.0). The soname is the release version: libreac.so.1.12.1,
    libreac-transport.so.1.12.1; the packages are libreac1.12.1 and
    libreac-transport1.12.1. Everything else is as in 1.12.0, below.

